WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.090 --> 00:05.200
[This series contains scenes of violence, self-harm, and potential triggers. Viewer discretion is advised.]

3
00:03.790 --> 00:05.920
It's been a while, Herod.

4
00:07.050 --> 00:07.840
You are...

5
00:08.000 --> 00:09.560
It's me, Jinyoung.

6
00:10.080 --> 00:11.900
You don't remember?

7
00:12.200 --> 00:13.460
That's quite sad.

8
00:14.340 --> 00:16.740
If I say this, will you remember something?

9
00:17.580 --> 00:18.860
That day in the school gym,

10
00:18.860 --> 00:21.420
before Adolph died, we were together.

11
00:21.880 --> 00:23.340
The video taken back then—

12
00:24.820 --> 00:26.700
I was going to sell it to your CEO.

13
00:26.990 --> 00:29.300
But we were classmates after all.

14
00:29.990 --> 00:33.560
I thought I should at least give my classmate a choice.

15
00:34.740 --> 00:36.590
I see you're quite popular lately.

16
00:36.590 --> 00:38.790
You must have made a lot of money, right?

17
00:41.150 --> 00:47.930
[Some scenes were created with AI.]

18
00:50.040 --> 00:53.780
[Adapted from the webtoon "The Sound of Sugar Cubes" by Kim Tak]

19
00:53.810 --> 00:56.590
[Screenwriter: So-on (JD)]

20
00:56.600 --> 00:59.550
[Director: Yoon Jinyoung]

21
01:16.110 --> 01:17.410
[Yoo Dohyun]

22
01:17.600 --> 01:19.160
[Cho Chanhyeon]

23
01:19.289 --> 01:20.890
[Ko Gyeol]

24
01:22.520 --> 01:25.830
[The Sound of Sugar Cubes]

25
01:33.370 --> 01:35.820
With this, Hanyul can live.

26
01:36.190 --> 01:38.340
Without this, you can live, right?

27
01:44.690 --> 01:45.850
Take it.

28
01:54.940 --> 01:57.240
This is your only chance.

29
02:14.840 --> 02:15.900
Take your hand off.

30
02:16.500 --> 02:18.030
-No need. -Seriously.

31
02:19.070 --> 02:20.130
Hey.

32
02:20.490 --> 02:21.250
Sorry.

33
02:21.390 --> 02:22.940
Next up is Herod's emergency press conference.

34
02:22.940 --> 02:23.740
Hey, Herod...

35
02:23.810 --> 02:25.030
What is he doing?

36
02:26.890 --> 02:40.000
[Herod holds an emergency press conference to announce his official stance]

37
02:42.530 --> 02:46.380
Regarding the recent news about Yul assaulting a classmate—

38
02:46.890 --> 02:49.030
I'm sure everyone's heard of it.

39
02:50.570 --> 02:52.070
Yul and I,

40
02:52.190 --> 02:54.130
along with the victim of the assault,

41
02:54.130 --> 02:56.329
were all classmates at the same school.

42
02:57.140 --> 02:59.050
We were very close friends, too.

43
03:01.510 --> 03:03.570
This is from the original video taken

44
03:03.830 --> 03:07.190
the day the assault occurred.

45
03:27.480 --> 03:28.890
This loser.

46
03:29.410 --> 03:30.390
Where's Hanyul?

47
03:32.790 --> 03:35.030
I told him to stay with Adolph.

48
03:41.560 --> 03:43.160
I bought snacks.

49
03:44.340 --> 03:45.400
What are you doing?

50
03:51.590 --> 03:54.530
This person... is me, right?

51
04:03.530 --> 04:04.700
Get up.

52
04:04.870 --> 04:06.360
Stop playing dead.

53
04:09.320 --> 04:10.740
Hey, is he really dead?

54
04:10.860 --> 04:11.830
Whatever.

55
04:11.960 --> 04:13.480
He's just an orphan anyway.

56
04:13.480 --> 04:15.200
No one will notice if he's gone.

57
04:15.200 --> 04:16.529
Didn't they say he and Lee Hanyul were super close?

58
04:16.529 --> 04:18.459
Idiot, Lee Hanyul is an orphan too.

59
04:18.529 --> 04:19.970
But he's also close with Herod.

60
04:19.970 --> 04:21.690
Herod likes Lee Hanyul.

61
04:21.839 --> 04:24.720
But Lee Hanyul sticks with this guy all day long.

62
04:25.040 --> 04:27.370
He'd definitely be happy if this guy died.

63
04:27.900 --> 04:29.480
Oh, you're here.

64
04:30.030 --> 04:32.290
Look at his face. It's hilarious, right?

65
04:32.860 --> 04:38.390
Composing music, yeah right. When I saw him playing the piano in the piano room I already thought...

66
04:53.390 --> 04:56.300
The person present that day wasn't Yul, but me.

67
04:58.210 --> 05:01.230
Although I didn't participate in the violence personally,

68
05:01.230 --> 05:03.640
I was indeed at the scene.

69
05:04.190 --> 05:06.080
In that moment, I hesitated.

70
05:06.990 --> 05:11.040
I turned a blind eye... to my friend's suffering.

71
05:11.920 --> 05:13.240
I am very sorry.

72
05:23.830 --> 05:27.690
Also, the song "Sound of Dawn" that I released is not my original work.

73
05:28.440 --> 05:30.290
I stole my friend's song

74
05:30.420 --> 05:32.409
and released it under my own name.

75
05:33.100 --> 05:35.740
You might ruin your career and reputation.

76
05:35.850 --> 05:39.520
Why did you suddenly choose to confess this right now?

77
05:39.860 --> 05:41.650
Are you trying to strike first

78
05:41.800 --> 05:43.780
because you want to hide something else?

79
05:43.780 --> 05:46.380
Then who is the real creator of "Sound of Dawn"?

80
05:46.430 --> 05:49.060
Is it this missing friend?

81
05:49.540 --> 05:51.150
Answer us.

82
05:51.300 --> 05:54.430
Did you hold a press conference just to talk to yourself?

83
05:56.420 --> 06:00.140
I stand here today to take responsibility for everything.

84
06:01.750 --> 06:03.690
From today on,

85
06:04.270 --> 06:07.290
I will stop all entertainment activities

86
06:07.880 --> 06:10.080
and leave the entertainment industry.

87
06:10.240 --> 06:13.490
I will carry my apologies to the victims for the rest of my life.

88
06:13.490 --> 06:16.390
I sincerely apologize to the victims

89
06:16.550 --> 06:19.920
and to Yul.

90
06:20.250 --> 06:22.950
Saying you'll take responsibility is just an excuse.

91
06:22.950 --> 06:25.630
You just want to strike first and run away, right?

92
06:25.630 --> 06:28.690
Do you mean you are willing to accept legal punishment?

93
06:28.740 --> 06:31.830
Did your agency, Dawn Entertainment, know and condone this?

94
06:31.830 --> 06:34.250
Is this an organized cover-up at the company level?

95
06:34.250 --> 06:36.909
How exactly do you plan to take responsibility?

96
06:37.180 --> 06:39.320
[Singer Herod admits to school violence and song plagiarism]

97
06:37.240 --> 06:40.370
Singer Herod held an emergency press conference today,

98
06:40.409 --> 06:44.210
publicly admitting to standing by while a classmate was assaulted,

99
06:44.230 --> 06:48.480
and to plagiarizing the hit song "Sound of Dawn."

100
06:48.770 --> 06:50.700
He publicly admitted his mistakes

101
06:50.710 --> 06:53.500
and firmly stated he will leave the entertainment industry.

102
06:53.500 --> 06:55.550
But the subsequent impact of this press conference

103
06:55.550 --> 06:58.620
will likely far exceed expectations.

104
06:58.850 --> 07:03.390
Especially since the police have officially launched an investigation into Herod's agency for suspected organized collusion

105
07:03.390 --> 07:06.160
and deliberate concealment.

106
07:06.170 --> 07:07.180
Hanyul.

107
07:07.500 --> 07:10.470
This company appears to be a large entertainment agency on the surface,

108
07:10.470 --> 07:16.230
but is actually suspected to be a major money laundering channel for a corporate syndicate.

109
07:10.810 --> 07:25.980
[Breaking News: Illegal loan organization using young children as collateral is affiliated with an entertainment company suspected of laundering tens of billions]

110
07:16.700 --> 07:21.420
While investigating the music distribution process and the entire flow of funds,

111
07:21.590 --> 07:25.880
the police plan to focus on the origins of the syndicate behind the agency.

112
07:32.850 --> 07:33.850
Where is Herod?

113
07:34.370 --> 07:36.030
He's not answering his phone.

114
07:40.860 --> 07:42.270
Did you do this?

115
07:43.159 --> 07:45.390
When you begged me for a week,

116
07:45.510 --> 07:48.650
was it actually to buy time for this kind of trick behind my back?

117
07:48.650 --> 07:50.220
No, boss.

118
07:53.159 --> 07:55.100
Just to save that kid,

119
07:56.820 --> 07:58.820
you're going to betray the company?

120
07:59.220 --> 08:01.040
You're just a dog,

121
08:01.170 --> 08:02.970
and you dare to bite your master?

122
08:09.660 --> 08:11.370
It's not like that.

123
08:15.090 --> 08:16.470
Then were you...

124
08:16.630 --> 08:19.600
so blinded by that kid

125
08:19.800 --> 08:23.730
that you couldn't even control the mouth of a singer under the company?

126
08:25.760 --> 08:28.820
This is dereliction of duty and negligence, Lee Won!

127
08:40.169 --> 08:41.309
Kidneys,

128
08:41.580 --> 08:43.159
liver,

129
08:43.679 --> 08:45.110
corneas,

130
08:50.050 --> 08:52.520
and hair. Even if I sell all of these,

131
08:52.740 --> 08:55.120
I'm still the one losing out.

132
08:56.940 --> 08:58.300
No.

133
08:58.630 --> 08:59.960
Chairman.

134
09:00.710 --> 09:03.410
You cannot touch him.

135
09:04.870 --> 09:06.040
All right then.

136
09:09.830 --> 09:12.660
Then... you die.

137
09:32.900 --> 09:35.140
What about you guys? Want some too?

138
09:37.730 --> 09:39.270
Why did you call him over?

139
09:39.990 --> 09:41.020
What's wrong?

140
09:41.150 --> 09:43.280
I called my friend to my hospital room,

141
09:43.300 --> 09:44.910
and you're not happy about it?

142
09:44.910 --> 09:46.690
What friend?

143
09:46.860 --> 09:48.120
He's just a criminal.

144
09:52.320 --> 09:53.580
Actually,

145
09:53.980 --> 09:56.710
I called him here because I have something to say.

146
09:57.960 --> 09:59.290
What is it?

147
10:00.080 --> 10:01.250
Ah.

148
10:01.450 --> 10:02.280
Oh.

149
10:02.460 --> 10:03.190
Are you okay?

150
10:03.230 --> 10:06.430
Memory, memory, memory.

151
10:10.420 --> 10:11.810
In the past...

152
10:13.050 --> 10:14.480
You two.

153
10:16.290 --> 10:17.780
You fought.

154
10:17.920 --> 10:19.220
You two fought.

155
10:20.340 --> 10:22.090
You used to fight over me all the time in high school.

156
10:22.090 --> 10:23.560
Are you fighting again?

157
10:23.970 --> 10:25.560
You scared me.

158
10:25.820 --> 10:27.080
Stop fighting.

159
10:27.200 --> 10:28.380
We're all friends.

160
10:29.060 --> 10:30.500
I'm sorry.

161
10:32.320 --> 10:33.980
I'm sorry, Adolph.

162
10:49.210 --> 10:51.520
I let you get hurt.

163
10:51.770 --> 10:53.530
And I took your song.

164
10:56.670 --> 10:58.970
I coveted everything you had.

165
10:59.910 --> 11:01.120
I'm sorry.

166
11:02.240 --> 11:04.210
I'm really sorry, Adolph.

167
11:07.550 --> 11:08.720
Yeah.

168
11:09.720 --> 11:11.230
You should be sorry.

169
11:12.430 --> 11:13.730
But...

170
11:19.020 --> 11:20.200
Adolph.

171
11:28.770 --> 11:30.300
Are you just going to say it?

172
11:35.020 --> 11:36.220
Take it out.

173
11:37.900 --> 11:39.910
I'm telling you to take out your wallet.

174
11:39.910 --> 11:41.590
Is a verbal apology enough?

175
11:41.990 --> 11:43.320
You're a complete thug.

176
11:43.390 --> 11:44.860
Hurry up and take it out.

177
12:00.310 --> 12:01.550
You two,

178
12:01.860 --> 12:03.910
make up already.

179
12:05.280 --> 12:06.410
I'm leaving.

180
12:07.090 --> 12:08.520
Hurry up.

181
12:43.500 --> 12:44.440
Oh.

182
12:45.940 --> 12:47.010
Where's Hanyul?

183
12:47.750 --> 12:49.840
With Herod, in the ward.

184
12:52.710 --> 12:53.660
Um,

185
12:55.310 --> 12:57.490
buy me some ice cream.

186
13:00.750 --> 13:03.480
What the hell? It's not even expensive ice cream.

187
13:07.450 --> 13:09.250
Is it okay to leave them alone?

188
13:11.490 --> 13:13.580
I don't mind.

189
13:13.830 --> 13:16.240
You're the one who should mind.

190
13:18.780 --> 13:20.130
Can you...

191
13:22.310 --> 13:24.040
forgive Herod?

192
13:25.820 --> 13:27.080
Forgive?

193
13:28.210 --> 13:30.470
I can't say for sure.

194
13:31.050 --> 13:33.870
But I owe him too.

195
13:36.770 --> 13:39.050
This kid probably has some good stuff in his bag.

196
13:39.050 --> 13:41.500
Really? Let me see.

197
13:41.740 --> 13:43.560
Let go, damn it.

198
13:44.350 --> 13:45.730
Let go, you bastard.

199
13:45.870 --> 13:46.710
Let go!

200
13:46.960 --> 13:48.220
Hey, get out of the way.

201
13:48.520 --> 13:50.560
Die, you bastard!

202
13:50.900 --> 13:52.830
It's too boring to end it like this.

203
13:53.420 --> 13:55.080
Would a guy's hole be tighter?

204
13:55.900 --> 13:58.400
He's a goody-two-shoes model student, so I bet it is.

205
13:58.400 --> 14:00.200
Hey, everyone get out of the way.

206
14:04.630 --> 14:05.810
I'm sorry.

207
14:07.240 --> 14:08.990
I know that no matter what I say,

208
14:09.120 --> 14:11.470
I can't make it up to you and Adolph.

209
14:19.140 --> 14:21.700
I will completely disappear from your sight.

210
14:24.930 --> 14:26.250
You know what?

211
14:34.350 --> 14:36.630
I was there too.

212
14:39.680 --> 14:42.430
[See you at the gym at 10 tonight!]

213
14:40.160 --> 14:42.650
See you at the gym at 10 tonight.

214
14:47.390 --> 14:48.780
Hey, is he really dead?

215
14:48.910 --> 14:49.950
Whatever.

216
14:50.110 --> 14:51.480
He's just an orphan anyway.

217
14:51.480 --> 14:53.180
No one will know if he's gone.

218
14:53.310 --> 14:54.580
Oh, you're here.

219
14:54.700 --> 14:55.690
Funny, right?

220
14:56.910 --> 14:58.980
Look at his face. It's hilarious, right?

221
14:58.980 --> 15:01.530
Composing music, yeah right. When I saw him playing the piano in the piano room

222
15:01.530 --> 15:02.990
I already thought he was super annoying.

223
15:02.990 --> 15:04.920
It's too boring to end it like this.

224
15:05.500 --> 15:07.160
Would a guy's hole be tighter?

225
15:07.280 --> 15:10.210
He's a goody-two-shoes model student, so I bet it is.

226
15:25.180 --> 15:27.150
I didn't save him.

227
15:28.190 --> 15:29.950
I chose to run away.

228
15:32.990 --> 15:34.500
Actually, you and I

229
15:34.950 --> 15:36.680
are essentially the same.

230
15:37.830 --> 15:40.290
So you don't have to apologize to me anymore.

231
15:43.850 --> 15:47.860
I was beaten by those classmates until I lost my memory.

232
15:48.030 --> 15:51.060
When I finally woke up again later,

233
15:52.120 --> 15:55.210
the first thing I saw

234
15:56.060 --> 15:58.020
was Herod's bare feet running

235
15:58.380 --> 16:00.430
with me on his back.

236
16:02.240 --> 16:03.570
Adolph!

237
16:03.970 --> 16:05.020
Are you okay?

238
16:05.430 --> 16:06.790
Hold on a little longer.

239
16:09.110 --> 16:12.040
And then I lost my memory again.

240
16:13.240 --> 16:17.050
When I woke up from time to time,

241
16:18.010 --> 16:23.020
Herod was always by my hospital bed.

242
16:23.720 --> 16:26.870
Herod really likes Hanyul.

243
16:27.530 --> 16:29.190
He must be very anxious.

244
16:29.550 --> 16:34.490
He probably did imagine how nice it would be without me.

245
16:34.940 --> 16:39.560
But even if he had such thoughts, he must've been in a lot of pain himself.

246
16:40.440 --> 16:42.560
Liking someone

247
16:42.970 --> 16:45.090
makes you really happy,

248
16:45.450 --> 16:47.580
but it's also something unfortunate.

249
16:52.860 --> 16:55.940
I wonder if they've made up by now.

250
17:05.579 --> 17:06.630
Here.

251
17:20.760 --> 17:22.240
Thank you.

252
17:23.000 --> 17:25.040
But why aren't you giving it to him yourself?

253
17:25.040 --> 17:26.900
Aren't you here to give him this?

254
17:27.920 --> 17:29.860
I promised Hanyul

255
17:30.770 --> 17:32.770
that I would help get your song back.

256
17:34.640 --> 17:36.350
Are you going somewhere?

257
17:51.180 --> 17:52.360
Where's Herod?

258
17:52.610 --> 17:53.680
Huh?

259
17:54.380 --> 17:55.630
He left.

260
17:55.870 --> 17:58.500
Terrible, leaving you all alone.

261
18:02.980 --> 18:03.970
Ta-da.

262
18:04.290 --> 18:05.170
What's this?

263
18:05.270 --> 18:06.680
Isn't this your sheet music?

264
18:05.540 --> 18:06.680
["Sound of Dawn" by Adolph]

265
18:07.040 --> 18:10.100
The great composer Lee gave it to me at the door just now.

266
18:10.330 --> 18:12.090
He said he promised you

267
18:12.270 --> 18:14.280
that he would help get this song back.

268
18:14.280 --> 18:15.940
Was he here?

269
18:16.710 --> 18:18.970
Then why didn't he give it to me directly?

270
18:19.000 --> 18:20.240
Tell me about it.

271
18:20.360 --> 18:21.670
How would I know?

272
18:27.900 --> 18:32.570
[Hanyul]

273
18:50.220 --> 18:51.480
Lee Won!

274
18:51.920 --> 18:54.130
Lee Won, come out! Lee Won!

275
18:54.260 --> 18:55.860
Are you still not coming out?

276
18:56.260 --> 18:57.360
Lee Won!

277
19:13.430 --> 19:14.690
Mr. Pan.

278
19:16.970 --> 19:18.550
Lee Won...

279
19:26.050 --> 19:27.220
What is this?

280
19:27.670 --> 19:28.850
Tonight's news—

281
19:28.990 --> 19:31.780
star composer Lee Won, suspected of planning and operating

282
19:31.780 --> 19:35.000
money laundering operations for an agency and a syndicate,

283
19:35.000 --> 19:36.800
turned himself in to the police.

284
19:37.200 --> 19:39.120
It is reported that Lee Won confessed to the allegations of falsifying performance fee contracts,

285
19:37.290 --> 19:40.570
[Composer Lee Won turns himself in to the police. Charges: Falsifying performance fee contracts, shell outsourcing contracts, operating borrowed-name companies. Confesses to all allegations.]

286
19:39.270 --> 19:40.580
shell outsourcing contracts,

287
19:40.580 --> 19:45.220
and operating borrowed-name companies.

288
19:45.540 --> 19:49.610
The scale of money laundering carried out by Lee Won reaches tens of billions of won,

289
19:49.610 --> 19:53.340
which applies to the suspicion of occupational embezzlement under the Act on the Aggravated Punishment of Specific Crimes.

290
19:51.560 --> 19:53.480
[Breaking News: Composer Lee Won turns himself in, admits to money laundering for agency/syndicate.]

291
19:53.470 --> 19:55.160
It is expected that he will be sentenced to at least 5 years in prison,

292
19:53.570 --> 19:55.540
[Composer Lee Won planned and operated: 1. Falsified performance fee contracts 2. Shell outsourcing contracts 3. Borrowed-name companies.]

293
19:55.230 --> 19:57.960
and up to a heavy sentence of more than 10 years...

294
19:59.140 --> 20:00.970
Lee Won asked me for a favor.

295
20:01.710 --> 20:03.600
He begged me to protect you

296
20:03.850 --> 20:05.250
and let you debut.

297
20:09.810 --> 20:15.640
[CEO: Lee Won]

298
20:18.940 --> 20:21.230
[Hanyul]

299
20:42.330 --> 20:44.940
[Yul_debut_project]

300
21:12.380 --> 21:13.840
Why are you guys here?

301
21:14.000 --> 21:15.600
It's about our own company,

302
21:16.170 --> 21:17.700
and it's also about Hanyul.

303
21:18.390 --> 21:19.790
Thank you.

304
21:25.170 --> 21:26.890
Fake contract for performance fees,

305
21:25.610 --> 21:28.190
[Lee Won (Confessed): Forged performance fee contracts; Shell outsourcing contracts; Operated borrowed-name companies; Designed slush fund structure]

306
21:27.040 --> 21:28.520
shell outsourcing contracts,

307
21:28.520 --> 21:29.880
operating a business under a borrowed name,

308
21:29.880 --> 21:32.250
designing a slush fund structure.

309
21:32.430 --> 21:34.340
These are the crimes Lee Won confessed to.

310
21:34.340 --> 21:35.420
But

311
21:35.720 --> 21:37.610
it's impossible that he directed all of this

312
21:37.610 --> 21:39.010
[Lee Won acting alone X]

313
21:37.630 --> 21:38.670
alone.

314
21:39.070 --> 21:40.610
The Lee Won I know

315
21:40.730 --> 21:42.920
follows the boss's orders.

316
